{"step": 1, "unit": "scripts/move-to-emeritus.py::_verify_review_candidates", "suspicions": [{"label": "a", "lines": [358, 359, 360, 361], "why": "The reviews of a candidate PR are fetched again on every call that reaches that PR, so a PR that is a candidate for several users in the same repo is fetched once per user. Nothing caches reviews per (repo, PR)."}]}
