{"step": 1, "unit": "scripts/move-to-emeritus.py::check_maintainer_activity", "suspicions": [{"label": "a", "lines": [597, 606, 615, 650, 662, 667], "why": "debug() is called with eagerly built f-strings even when DEBUG is False. Line 650 also runs `_extract_numbers(authored_result)` for every user with authored PRs, only to format the debug message."}]}
