{"step": 1, "unit": "scripts/move-to-emeritus.py::main", "suspicions": [{"label": "a", "lines": [1323, 1326, 1327], "why": "get_team_repos fetches every repo of each team before the --repo filter at lines 1326 and 1327 is applied, so a run restricted to one repo still pages through every team's full repo list."}]}

